// A call may not be an argument to a call, and a name bound before a while
// loop's condition is only read once, where the loop needs it read again
// every iteration; composing the byte fetch and the classifier into one
// function lets the loop call it directly instead (docs/SPEC.md section 7).
is_hspace_at(word base, int i) {
  int c = peek8(base + i);
  int ok = is_hspace(c);
} return int ok;
given lex_src_fixture ((import gb), 4):(1)
given lex_src_fixture ((import gb), 0):(0)

